-> Object merge via + operator

-> Merge two objects
a = { x = 1, y = 2 }
b = { z = 3 }
merged = a + b
assert merged.x = 1
assert merged.y = 2
assert merged.z = 3

-> Merge overlapping keys (second object wins)
left = { name = "old", x = 1 }
right = { name = "new", y = 2 }
combined = left + right
assert combined.x = 1
assert combined.y = 2
